OL,4,BWomen's Six Nations 2024: Former       
OL,5,BEngland captain Sarah Hunter now       
OL,6,Bcomfortable as a coach                 
OL,7, England's most-capped player Sarah     
OL,8, Hunter admits she was initially not    
OL,9, "comfortable" in her new role as       
OL,10, defence coach, but now feels she is    
OL,11, settling in.                           
OL,13,FThe 38-year-old retired last season    
OL,14,Fafter victory over Scotland at Kingston
OL,15,FPark in her side's opening Women's Six 
OL,16,FNations game.                          
OL,18,FThe former England captain then started
OL,19,Fher new role in September.             
